    1. (Let (header tid { (typeIR_f id_f ;)* }) be (typeIR'' as headerTypeIR))

    2. (Let value_cast be $cast_op(typeIR_f, value))*

    3. Return ((header tid { (value_cast id_f ;)* }) as value)

